 * A movie a user marked as favorite.
 *
 * <p>References the movie by its TMDB id only — movie data itself lives in movie-service
 * (database-per-service, ADR-002); clients hydrate details via the facade. The (user, movie) pair
 * is unique so a movie can be favorited at most once; the service layer treats repeat adds as
 * idempotent.
 */
@Entity
